' Scene doors and the other trader's film (`ImageScene`; `preset
' classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 8`). Behind room 10 film_02 (the
' ruin's song), behind room 12 film_04 (the building's); nothing opens
' after either. The trader's door (room 13) shows film_10 first.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 395,292         ' into the place
wait 60
mapclick 169,164         ' room 10: film_02
wait 150
snap film02
esc
wait 10
mapclick 425,291         ' room 12: film_04
wait 200
snap film04
esc
wait 10
mapclick 297,227         ' room 13, the trader: film_10
wait 200
snap film10
esc
wait 10
snap trader_after_film10
esc
wait 10
quit
